//! An exact native port of the Victris Arena game engine (official engine 0.23.0).
//!
//! The official engine is about 2,000 lines of TypeScript with integer-only math. This
//! crate reproduces its match state tick for tick: the conformance tool in this workspace
//! checks every tick's state hash against ladder replays and against games generated by
//! the official simulator.
//!
//! Everything a bot needs is on [`Engine`]: build one from the rules and map in `hello`,
//! then `new_match`, `step`, and `state_hash`. [`State`] is flat and `Copy`.

